; json — RFC 8259 JSON: a pull reader, a value tree built on it, and a
; writer that appends into a growable byte buffer.
;
; Its uses: the language server's JSON-RPC traffic, the
; HttpArena JSON endpoint and, later, FHIR resources. A number keeps its
; SOURCE TEXT, so a FHIR decimal (`1.50`) goes out as it came in; the
; conversions to i64 and f64 are accessors. The modules, in dependency order:

package scaly 0.1.0

define json
{
    module Reader
    module Value
    module Writer
}
